  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Iron-Apples.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"131\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firon-apples\" rel=\"nofollow\">Теперь на Modrinth!</a></span></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Iron-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"524\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Enchanted-Iron-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"989\" height=\"159\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Copper-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"574\" height=\"159\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Enchanted-Copper-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"159\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Crystal-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"601\" height=\"159\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Enchanted-Crystal-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Diamond-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"159\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Enchanted-Diamond-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"154\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Silver-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"539\" height=\"155\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Enchanted-Silver-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1081\" height=\"159\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Obsidian-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"658\" height=\"155\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Infer4Y/IronImages/raw/main/Enchanted-Obsidian-Apple.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Этот мод был запрошен разработчиками Minecraft Modding Development. Он добавляет в игру Железные Яблоки, которые можно скрафтить по этим рецептам (также в игру возвращён рецепт God Apple).</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Рецепты показаны на изображениях</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Сверхмощные Кристальные Яблоки можно скрафтить из блоков, имеющих в словаре руд тег <em><strong>glassClear</strong></em>. <strong>Разрешается добавлять этот мод в любые пакеты модов</strong></span></p>",
